<h2>Arrangement of "Owl" from Link's Awakening</h2>
<audio controls src=https://github.com/Thysbelon/Thaumoc/raw/refs/heads/main/example-files/GB_DMG/owl/owl_007_amp.flac style=width:100%></audio>
<p>This is a cover of the song "<span lang=ja>フクロウ</span>" (Owl) from the 2019 remake of Link's Awakening for the Nintendo Switch. This cover was made using an emulated Game Boy soundchip via <a href=https://github.com/Thysbelon/Thaumoc target=_blank>Thaumoc</a>, as a reference to the original Game Boy version of Link's Awakening.
<p><a download=owl_007-2.mid href=https://github.com/Thysbelon/Thaumoc/raw/refs/heads/main/example-files/GB_DMG/owl/owl_007-2.mid>Owl arrangement midi download</a>.

<h2>"Tal Tal Heights - Link's Awakening" and "SWORD - DELTARUNE" Mashup</h2>
<audio controls src="https://github.com/Thysbelon/Thaumoc/raw/refs/heads/main/example-files/GB_DMG/LinksAwakeningTalTal-X-DeltaruneSwordMashup/Link'sAwakeningTalTal_011_1.flac" style=width:100%></audio>
<p>A mashup of Tal Tal Heights from The Legend of Zelda - Link's Awakening for the Game Boy, and SWORD from DELTARUNE: Chapter 3.
<p>SWORD was already composed to sound like a Zelda overworld song, and I think it may bear a particular resemblance to Tal Tal Heights, so I wanted to make a mashup that highlights the similarities between these two songs.
<p>This mashup was made by using <a href=https://github.com/Thysbelon/gbs2midi target=_blank>gbs2midi</a> and <a href=https://github.com/Thysbelon/Thaumoc target=_blank>Thaumoc</a> to edit the music of Link's Awakening. I also used this <a href=https://musescore.com/user/47584166/scores/26267098 target=_blank>sheet music of SWORD transcribed by gubgub</a>.
<p><a download="Link'sAwakeningTalTal_011_1.mid" href="https://github.com/Thysbelon/Thaumoc/raw/refs/heads/main/example-files/GB_DMG/LinksAwakeningTalTal-X-DeltaruneSwordMashup/Link'sAwakeningTalTal_011_1.mid">Tal Tal Heights and SWORD mashup midi download</a>.

