<p>Back in April 2025, I had fun making a cover of the intro of Katamaritaino where the acoustic guitar is replicated by 6 channels of the N163 chip, one channel for each string of a guitar. I lost interest in the idea of covering the entire song, but I'm still proud of the little bit that I made. <a download href=katamaritaino6.fms>WIP Katamaritaino cover FamiStudio project download</a>.

